  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Slice 2b real-interpreter proof demo (member/subordinate side): reads WorkingState.Commander (an Entity set by the host before ticking), passes it as the GetShared node\u0027s \u0027Target\u0027 pin to read the COORDINATOR entity\u0027s Entity-scoped \u0027rally\u0027 shared slot (SquadRallyState) cross-entity, mirrors RallyCount into WorkingState.RallyCountMirror via a pure FunctionCall \u002B SetVariable, and mirrors the \u0027Found\u0027 flag into WorkingState.FoundMirror. Proves GetShared\u0027s optional Target pin compiles to BlueprintSharedState.TryGetShared\u003CT\u003E(world, \u003Cresolved target entity\u003E, variableId, out value) instead of self, and that TryGetShared returns false (FoundMirror stays false, RallyCountMirror stays 0) when the coordinator hasn\u0027t provisioned the slot -- never throws.",
    "Category": null,
    "Recipe": null
  }
